WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.745
AI is smart. The way we
use it is frustratingly dumb:

00:00:03.745 --> 00:00:06.888
agents miss what is new,
rewrite existing code,

00:00:06.888 --> 00:00:08.880
and stall on long queues.

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:12.954
Teleion Labs builds Teleion
Fabric so agents share work,

00:00:12.954 --> 00:00:17.101
check results with a separate
key, and reuse vetted kits,

00:00:17.101 --> 00:00:20.840
free with no account through
December 31, 2026.

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:26.358
Measured on recorded runs: zero
lease collisions across 256 workers,

00:00:26.358 --> 00:00:31.714
hourly self-tuning over Meta's Muse
Spark 1.3 and Muse Wonder 1.0,

00:00:31.714 --> 00:00:35.204
and 97.8 percent
held-out Task-splitting F1

00:00:35.204 --> 00:00:38.770
on our compact Muse Glimmer 30B adapter.

00:00:38.770 --> 00:00:41.436
Eranos shows Teleion Fabric working

00:00:41.436 --> 00:00:45.015
for nonprofits on cited
public-source requests.

00:00:45.015 --> 00:00:47.300
Start free at teleionlabs.com,

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:51.567
or lend spare AI capacity
at eranosforgood.org.
